message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenTCM Discovery"
abstract: "An open MCP service for traditional Chinese medicine small-molecule discovery. It retrieves pathways and ingredients from public databases, checks whether several sources record the same entity, and runs AutoDock Vina only when a literature-defined pocket is available. Results are hypotheses with source and query time, not clinical advice."
url: "https://github.com/S0mbraD/OpenTCM_Discovery"
authors:
